[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6224084970","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122086#issuecomment-6224084970","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122086","id":6224084970,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcvv_6g","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T20:27:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T20:27:55Z","body":"The reason is that a TabContainer misbehaves if there are no tabs. The internal container next to the TabBar is not considered in minimum size calculations, which causes the buttons to go out of bounds or even disappear. But even if it's included in minimum size, something is still wrong. No idea what's the reason.\n\nAnd as a related issue, trying to drag dock tabs into empty bottom panel spams errors about tab out of bounds.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6224084970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6261587575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122086#issuecomment-6261587575","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122086","id":6261587575,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdTg-dw","user":{"login":"AegisTTN","id":127440499,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5iWcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127440499?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN","html_url":"https://github.com/AegisTTN","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AegisTTN/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-19T06:59:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T08:43:25Z","body":"Currently working on this. \n\nThis happens because of two things:\n\n- The First, as mentioned, is TabContainer's minimum size just taking into account the TabBar and not its full internal_container. This caused the panel to collapse and also the disappearance of the buttons as in\t`internal_container->set_anchor_and_offset(SIDE_TOP, 1.0, top_margin - _get_tab_height())`, located on `TabContainer::_repaint_internal()`, tab height is not taking into account the internal_container.\n\n- The second is `_repaint_internal` was not being called when closing the final tab when it's hidden, as \"tab_changed\" was not emitted, this caused the floating buttons as the position of the buttons wasn't being updated.\n\nFor the fix should both these be in the same PR as both are to fix this or should they be split into separate PRs for the subproblems they fix?\n\n> Note: This will just make the bottom dock work correctly, not having the buttons floating, not give it the ability to be fully hidden as that is, currently, its intended behaviour.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6261587575/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6263599757","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122086#issuecomment-6263599757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122086","id":6263599757,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdVbyjQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-19T09:03:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:03:15Z","body":"> For the fix should both these be in the same PR\n\nYes","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6263599757/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]